# The memory CLI and the modules it imports are code, not memory: Pulse and the
# dashboard read `memory_cli.py status --json` through mq-agent, so the producer
# must survive a fresh clone. The data beside it (inbox, feedback, journals,
# scores, local/) stays ignored.
